sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as /api-keys Settings
  participant Start as /api/connections/chatgpt/start
  participant DB as Neon (oauth_attempts & chatgpt_connections)
  participant OpenAI as OpenAI OAuth Endpoint
  participant Callback as /api/connections/chatgpt/callback

  User->>UI: Click "Connect ChatGPT Plus/Team"
  UI->>Start: GET request to initiate OAuth
  Start->>DB: Store hashed state & PKCE secrets in oauth_attempts (10m TTL)
  Start-->>User: 302 Redirect to OpenAI Authorization Screen
  User->>OpenAI: Authorize application
  OpenAI-->>User: 302 Redirect to Callback with code & state
  User->>Callback: GET with code & state
  Callback->>DB: Verify & delete matching state in oauth_attempts
  Callback->>OpenAI: Exchange authorization code for tokens
  OpenAI-->>Callback: Return access & refresh tokens
  Callback->>Callback: Encrypt tokens using AES-256-GCM (lib/connection-crypto.ts)
  Callback->>DB: Persist encrypted credentials in chatgpt_connections
  Callback-->>User: Redirect to /api-keys with success banner
